        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    unearned_income = 3400\n    tax_free_threshold = 1250\n    alex_rate_threshold = 2500\n    alex_tax_rate = 0.10\n    parent_tax_rate = 0.24\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    alex_taxable_income = alex_rate_threshold - tax_free_threshold\n    income_taxed_at_parent_rate = unearned_income - alex_rate_threshold\n\n    tax_at_alex_rate = alex_taxable_income * alex_tax_rate\n    tax_at_parent_rate = income_taxed_at_parent_rate * parent_tax_rate\n    total_kiddie_tax = tax_at_alex_rate + tax_at_parent_rate\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(total_kiddie_tax)\n```",
